。下列说法正确的是（）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a713049fc45960dcbd5ee73b1d35d291bde4532beecae34168cb9e0fc7f0ecdc.png","width":235,"height":234,"width_mm":27.552,"row_group":"gaosan-wuxiao-lianmeng-2412-q11-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第11题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 环状彩灯的宽度 d 为 3cm"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 彩灯发出的黄光射出水面的最长时间为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{2}{3c}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 若彩灯发出红光，则水面透光区域将变小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 水面观察者观察到彩灯的深度比实际深度深，且与观察者的位置有关"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-wuxiao-lianmeng-2412-q12","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-wuxiao-lianmeng-2412","source_question_id":"gaosan-wuxiao-lianmeng-2412-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d7dfacd5b3dcd0463d032f89b7a0f3acf5cfbe73f5bdb5225f05fcbc4ec88689","body":[{"type":"text","value":"12. 甲、乙两波源发出的两列简谐横波，在同一均匀介质中分别沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正向和负向传播， "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻两列波恰在原点 O 相遇，t=1s 时在 x 轴上的 -3m～3m 区间内第一次形成如图所示的波形。P、Q 是平衡位置分别在 x=1m 和 2m 处的质点。对于该波，下列说法正确的是（）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4d3c2fe1b72e63b5be11dece13e07b57e7a9ba3211ac7aa2cd99f340c88a095d.png","width":380,"height":263,"width_mm":44.476,"row_group":"gaosan-wuxiao-lianmeng-2412-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第12题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 甲、乙两波源的起振方向分别为向下和向上"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 两波的频率均为 0.4Hz"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. t=3s 时，Q 质点的位移为 6cm"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 从起振到 t=3s 时，P 质点通过的总路程为 6cm"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-wuxiao-lianmeng-2412-q13","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-wuxiao-lianmeng-2412","source_question_id":"gaosan-wuxiao-lianmeng-2412-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0d5006477a43193ea2da030c610879c50d5a92c6477e00174b4148b4