i rnB\\Delta v}{R}\\cdot 2\\pi r\\cdot \\Delta t = \\frac{4\\pi^2n^2r^2B^2A}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"故"},{"type":"math","value":"I_{F}=\\frac{4\\pi^{2}n^{2}r^{2}B^{2}A}{R}-\\frac{mF_{0}R}{4\\pi^{2}n^{2}B^{2}r^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n(4)设导体棒向右经过"},{"type":"math","value":"x = +\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} A"},{"type":"text","value":"位置时的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":"，导体棒回复力与位移的比例系数为"},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":"。对棒从"},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":"向极端位置运动过程，由动能定理可得："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot kA \\cdot A = 0 - \\frac{1}{2} mv_m^2"},{"type":"text","value":"对棒从"},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":"向"},{"type":"math","value":"x = +\\frac{\\sqrt{3}A}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"位置的运动过程，由动能定理可得："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot k(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}A}{2})^2 = \\frac{1}{2} mv^2 - \\frac{1}{2} mv_m^2"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac{1}{2} v_m = \\frac{F_0R}{8\\pi^2n^2B^2r^2} = 0.15\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"k = \\frac{mv_m^2}{A^2} = 0.4\\mathrm{N / m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）由导体棒回复力与位移大小成正比的特点可知导体棒向右经过"},{"type":"math","value":"x = +\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} A"},{"type":"text","value":"位置时有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4\\pi^2n^2B^2r^2v}{R} - F = -k \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}A}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"F = \\frac{4\\pi^2n^2B^2r^2v}{R} - k \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}A}{2} = \\frac{1}{2} F_0 - k \\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}A}{2} = (6 - 0.2\\sqrt{3})\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）因此"},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":"的功率"},{"type":"math","value":"P_F = Fv = (0.9 - 0.009\\sqrt{3})\\mathrm{W} \\approx 0.88\\mathrm{W}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-wuxiao-lianmeng-2412-q20","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-wuxiao-lianmeng-2412","source_question_id":"gaosan-wuxiao-lianmeng-2412-q20"