frac{1}{2} mv_0^2"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{4}{3} d = v_0\\cos \\alpha t"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac{2}{3\\cos\\alpha}\\sqrt{\\frac{md}{eE}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（2）设粒子入射角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta'"},{"type":"text","value":"时，粒子恰好从"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"点射出，由于粒子进入电场时，在水平方向做匀速直线运动，在竖直方向反复做加速相同的减速运动，加速运动。粒子的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v' = \\sqrt{\\frac{2E_{k}}{m}} = \\frac{4}{3}\\sqrt{\\frac{3eEd}{m}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"t _ {\\text{总}} = \\frac {\\frac {4}{3} d}{v ^ {'} \\cos \\theta^ {'}} = \\frac {2}{\\cos \\theta^ {'}} \\cdot \\sqrt {\\frac {m d}{3 e E}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n竖直方向上"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y1}^{2}-v_{y0}^{2}=-2a\\frac{d}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":";"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y2}^{2}-v_{y1}^{2}=2a\\frac{d}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":";"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y3}^{2}-v_{y2}^{2}=-2a\\frac{d}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":";"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y4}^{2}-v_{y3}^{2}=2a\\frac{d}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":";\n所以："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y0}=v_{y2}=v_{y4}"},{"type":"text","value":";"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y1}=v_{y3}"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n则粒子在分层电场中运动时间相等，设为"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\text{则} t _ {0} = \\frac {1}{4} t _ {\\text{总}} \\text{且} \\quad \\frac {d}{4} = v ^ {'} \\sin \\theta \\cdot t _ {0} - \\frac {1}{2} \\frac {e E}{m} \\cdot t _ {0} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n代入数据化简可得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan^{2}\\theta'-8\\tan\\theta'+7=0"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan \\theta' = 7"},{"type":"text","value":"（舍去）或"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan \\theta' = 1"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta' = \\frac{\\pi}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"则从"},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":"边出射的粒子与入射粒子的数量之比"},{"type":"math","value":"N:N_0 = 1:1"},{"type":